# Graphify — always keep the graph current

This repo uses graphify at `graphify-out/`.

## After any code edit (required)

When you modify application source (Kotlin, TS/TSX, etc.), run before ending the turn:

```powershell
cd "d:\Projects\MRP New"; graphify update .
```

(AST-only, no API cost.) Do not skip because the change was "small."

## Before answering codebase questions

1. If `graphify-out/graph.json` exists, prefer `graphify query "..."`, `graphify path "A" "B"`, or `graphify explain "..."` over broad grep.
2. If `graphify-out/wiki/index.md` exists, use it for navigation.
3. Read `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md` only for broad architecture review.

## Do not

- Commit `graphify-out` churn unless the user asks
- Run a full `/graphify` rebuild unless update is insufficient or the user asks
